<title>FRANCE: Eiffage down 18 pct after requoting.</title>
<headline>Eiffage down 18 pct after requoting.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in public works group Eiffage requoted 18 percent lower after a second suspension on Monday.</p>
<p>The share was down 70 francs at 328 at 0920 GMT.</p>
<p>Earlier the company reported a first-half net attributable loss of 890 million francs, forecast a similar loss for the year and suspended its 1996 dividend.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
